,"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0139","start":139,"end":142,"surface":"太子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"woj_cq6_ajq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"呂媭","kind":"person","person_id":"68y_cvr_pg1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"呂他","kind":"person","person_id":"ozm_m75_ta9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0170","start":170,"end":173,"surface":"呂更始","kind":"person","person_id":"g5b_oty_6le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m009-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"呂忿","kind":"person","person_id":"2j3_uzv_a2x","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","book_id":"b-shiji-009","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p010","text":"宣平侯女為孝惠皇后時，無子，詳為有身，取美人子名之，殺其母，立所名子為太子。孝惠崩，太子立為帝。帝壯，或聞其母死，非真皇后子，乃出言曰：「后安能殺吾母而名我？我未壯，壯即為變。」太后聞而患之，恐其為亂，乃幽之永卷中，言帝病甚，左右莫得見。太后曰：「凡有天下治為萬民命者，蓋之如天，容之如地，上有歡心以安百姓，百姓欣然以事其上，歡欣交通而天下治。今皇帝病久不已，乃失惑惛亂，不能繼嗣奉宗廟祭祀，不可屬天下，其代之。」群臣皆頓首言：「皇太后為天下齊民計所以安宗廟社稷甚深，群臣頓首奉詔。」帝廢位，太后幽殺之。五月丙辰，立常山王義為帝，更名曰弘。不稱元年者，以太后制天下事也。以軹侯朝為常山王。置太尉官，絳侯勃為太尉。五年八月，淮陽王薨，以弟壺關侯武為淮陽王。六年十月，太后曰呂王嘉居處驕恣，廢之，以肅王台弟呂產為呂王。夏，赦天下。封齊悼惠王子興居為東牟侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m010-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"宣平侯女","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_2so_obo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m010-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m010-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"ant_2so_obo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m010-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"美人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或稱號仍待